nouveaux challengers et ma\u00eetrisez votre \u00e9quipe pour devenir le champion.\n\n\u26bd Football arcade rapide et accessible\n\ud83d\udca5 Tirs puissants et effets spectaculaires\n\ud83c\udfc6 Mode Aventure et nouveaux adversaires\n\u2694\ufe0f Duels intenses\n\ud83c\udf10 Multijoueur\n\ud83c\udfae Gameplay simple \u00e0 prendre en main\n\ud83c\udf0b Plusieurs terrains aux ambiances diff\u00e9rentes\n\nPas de simulation compliqu\u00e9e : Soccer Punch mise sur le fun, l'action et les moments compl\u00e8tement fous.\n\nFrappez. Marquez. Dominez.", "short_description": "Du football arcade explosif en VR ! Frappez, marquez, d\u00e9clenchez des tirs surpuissants et affrontez vos adversaires dans des matchs rapides, fun et compl\u00e8tement d\u00e9jant\u00e9s."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "a864a038-4c18-43ea-a15a-d21644d07fe3.png", "id": "28870799872609178", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622916_28870799882609177_6441625374230829210_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2tDLIA9CwngQ7kNvwGtSwmw&_nc_oc=AdoNN8v1aR66KWyhhCCdErRVizwB2zCArmcXZIeu_8oc8CjOUm3MSBzQwd-diRID7RA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS-CxTE6jRANXakcoJglGPhUnFh89h1q5avuKSfut0ZDg&oe=6AF72874"}, {"file_name": "51358611-9332-4dac-9eab-58932b81e2b5.png", "id": "2543643102803863", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/593938515_2543643106137196_8952066171315200993_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=py46OKiEvpsQ7kNvwFtwVhg&_nc_oc=AdpKtNCvZaeH041LS53OvFOB-MWQhkahv-nm7fW5-k_bfqPwTh9fBCUGkYZIRu4qIeY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQShjOT4MqbsFrDmDS0CpUnsuGHMCaP8h86zDdsPKFncaA&oe=6AF74642"}, {"file_name": "5f0d859c-364d-49be-8262-f573466e51d6.png", "id": "1743732340259519", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620559_174373234